_DA = [("A", "Lola, pababa po nang pababa ang timbang n’yo. Ano po ba ang lagi n’yong kinakain?", "Lola, your weight keeps going down and down. What do you always eat?"), ("B", "Kanin, itlog at tuyo po halos araw-araw.", "Rice, egg and dried fish almost every day."), ("A", "Ok po yan pero kailangan nyo pong kumain ng gulay at prutas lalo na yung mayaman sa hibla gaya ng pechay at pinya. Para ho kasi silang walis sa ating bituka. Nililinis nila ang kolesterol sa ating katawan. Nang sa ganun maging maayos ang daloy ng dugo sa mga ugat po ng katawan natin. Lola, para sa kalusugan n’yo ho ito.", "That is okay, but you need to eat vegetables and fruit, especially those rich in fiber such as pechay and pineapple. They are like a broom in our intestines. They clean the cholesterol in our body, so that the flow of blood in the veins of our body is good. Lola, this is for your health."), ("B", "Wala naman akong pambili, ma’am. Itlog at tuyo lang ang kaya ko.", "I have nothing to buy it with, ma’am. Egg and dried fish are all I can afford."), ("A", "Naku, Lola, mura po sa palengke ang mabeberdeng gulay, mga butong gulay, o mga pagkaing butil. Sariwa pa. At saka kailangan nyo rin pong kumain ng karne, pampalakas po ito.", "Oh, Lola, green leafy vegetables, legumes or grains are cheap at the market. They are fresh too. And you also need to eat meat, it gives strength."), ("B", "Mahal po ang karne, ma’am.", "Meat is expensive, ma’am."), ("A", "Lola, puwede po namang tokwa. Sagana din po ito sa sustansya katulad ng karne. At mas mura pa.", "Lola, tofu will do. It is also rich in nutrients like meat. And it is cheaper.")]
