_L8A = [("Jenny", "Ay, naku, Inay. Ano po yan inihanda ninyo? Pritong karne po ba ’yan?", "Oh my, Inay. What is that you prepared? Is that fried meat?"), ("Salud", "Hindi ito karne, anak. Tokwa ito na gawa sa soy beans. Ang sustansiyang dulot nito ay katulad din ng sustansiyang binibigay ng isda o karne.", "It is not meat, child. It is tofu made from soy beans. The nutrients it gives are the same as the nutrients that fish or meat give."), ("Ernie", "Sino naman ang nagsabi sa ’yo niyan, Salud?", "Who told you that, Salud?"), ("Salud", "E, nabasa ko dun sa clippings na ipinahiram sa akin ni mareng Mina. Naku, marami akong natututunan dun. Gaya nga nitong sustansiyang binibigay ng tokwa ’tsaka yung mga berdeng gulay na mabibili nang mura sa palengke, maging ang mga butong gulay, gaya ng munggo na kasing sustansiya ng ibang karne. Marami palang murang pagkain na mabibili pero sagana sa sustansiya.", "Well, I read it in the clippings that Mareng Mina lent me. Oh, I am learning a lot there. Like the nutrients that tofu gives, and the green vegetables that can be bought cheaply at the market, even legumes, like mung beans that are as nutritious as other meat. So there is a lot of cheap food that can be bought but is rich in nutrients.")]
_L8B = [("Oliver", "Kung dati’y tuyo at itlog ang lagi mong baon, ba, ngayon iba na, a. Lutong gulay na, a! At araw-araw iba-iba, ha.", "If before it was dried fish and egg that you always brought as baon, well, now it is different. It is cooked vegetables now! And different every day, too."), ("Ernie", "Oo, Oliver. At luto ’yan ng misis ko. Kasi ang gusto niya masustansiya ang kinakain ko, dahil nga mabigat ang trabaho natin. Para hindi agad ako nanghihina.", "Yes, Oliver. And my wife cooked that. She wants what I eat to be nutritious because our work is heavy. So that I do not get weak right away."), ("Oliver", "Napansin ko nga, Ernie. Mas malakas na ang resistensiya mo ngayon, e. Di gaya ng dati.", "I noticed that, Ernie. Your immunity is stronger now. Not like before."), ("Ernie", "Dahil ’yan kay Mrs.", "That is thanks to the Mrs.")]
_K8 = [("Passage 1, item 1", "Three people are talking (mother, father, daughter)."), ("Passage 1, item 2", "The mother is frying tofu."), ("Passage 1, item 3", "(1) Tofu is made from soy beans; (2) the nutrients from tofu are the same as the nutrients from fish and meat."), ("Passage 1, item 4", "She learned that tofu has lots of nutrients; that green leafy vegetables sold cheap in the wet market are also rich in nutrients; and that legumes are as nutritious as meat."), ("Passage 2, item 1", "Oliver has been bringing packed meals of vegetable dish every day. He used to bring egg and dried fish. Ernie also noticed that Oliver has a stronger immune system, unlike before. (In the printed script the observer is Oliver and the person observed is Ernie; the book’s key swaps the names.)"), ("Passage 2, item 2", "Blue collar, labor intensive."), ("Passage 2, item 3", "His wife.")]
_L9 = [("Mommy", "Carol, si mommy mo to. Yung mga anak mo ha pakainin mo ng gulay. Wag puro chichirya. Ibili mo sila ng sariwang gulay sa palengke gaya ng kalabasa. Maganda yan sa mata. Basta bigyan mo sila ng gulay at prutas lalo na ’yung mayaman sa hibla. Lilinaw na ang mata nila, gaganda pa ang kanilang kutis at saka lalakas ang resistensya nila.", "Carol, this is your mommy. Make your children eat vegetables, okay. Not just chichirya. Buy them fresh vegetables at the market like squash. It is good for the eyes. Just give them vegetables and fruit, especially those rich in fiber. Their eyes will become clear, their skin will become even more beautiful and their immunity will grow stronger.")]
_SPX = [("A", "Ano’ng ihahanda mo para sa hapunan?", "What will you prepare for dinner?"), ("B", "Para sa hapunan, ihahanda ko ang halu-halong gulay at inihaw na bagong-huling isda. Masustansiya ang mga gulay na ito, at walang masyadong taba ang isda. Sariwang prutas ang aming pangmatamis.", "For dinner, I will prepare mixed vegetables and grilled freshly caught fish. These vegetables are nutritious, and the fish does not have much fat. Fresh fruit is our dessert.")]
